// [DRAFT] D305 — Malik asks to be led out of the laboratory; refusing is not possible.
say|MALIK|Friends! My brave, my dear friends! Allow me to introduce myself: Malik, a humble merchant.
say|MALIK|Get me out of here — and at my humble place every one of you gets gold. Lots of gold.
say|KUSAKAM|We can barely stand ourselves. I can't promise anything...
say|MALIK|Can't promise — then don't! Just go on ahead, and I'll follow, quiet as a shadow. Deal? Deal!
say|URIZEN|The contract is sealed. The God of Contracts has heard.
exit|
